# The Dockerfile clones the repo itself via `git clone` (see REPO_URL/REPO_REF build
# args) rather than COPYing from the local build context -- nothing in this directory
# is ever read by the build. Ignoring everything keeps `docker build .` fast and
# side-effect-free no matter which directory (or how large/dirty a local checkout) you
# run it from.
*
